From 01df027e6922bb8e1e714e211fde6e494e9bfae0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 00:06:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Expansion foundation: chapter order behind exp, save
 format 6, chapter-10 start

ORDER gains the expanded campaign's four keys (throttle, survey, ballastra,
balances) as empty chapter shells the story passes straight through. A save
on exp_base keeps the base game's order and numbers. Save format 6 with the
v5 -> v6 migration (EXP-PLAN section 6), an unknown-key fallback, and the
Load menu's "Expanded campaign: start at chapter 10" into a new slot.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019FncRbDPGNFw93M8UijYsd
